## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

Each entry in `sources` is populated by the same conversion code as the
singular [`identitynow_source_v1` data source](../data-sources/source_v1.md) -
see its "Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes" section for the full list
of limitations shared by both.

`GET /sources/v1`'s documented maximum `limit` is 250; requested limits
above that are capped with a warning rather than an error.
